{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12206070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12206070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1220607001:1":{"text":"直った！本当に……直してくれたのね！こ……これ、魔法でしょ！？","source_cn":"修复了！你真的……做到了！这……这一定是魔法吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF644705C1F89B2C5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"直った！本当に……直してくれたのね！こ……これ、魔法でしょ！？","female":"直った！本当に……直してくれたのね！こ……これ、魔法でしょ！？","variant_male_record_index":"134467","variant_female_record_index":"134468","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1220607002:1":{"text":"あなたたちは……エスペリアで最も偉大なメイジね！","source_cn":"你们……你们简直就是伊索米亚最伟大、最传奇、最英气、最...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4868CE7434DAE76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1220607002":{"text":"あなたたちは……エスペリアで最も偉大なメイジね！","source_cn":"你们……你们简直就是伊索米亚最伟大、最传奇、最英气、最可爱的魔法师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4868CE7434DAE76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220607003:1":{"text":"ううん……私にとってこの星座表はとても大切なの……","source_cn":"不……你不清楚这对我来说有多重要……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE64F838771A30F75","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ううん……私にとってこの星座表はとても大切なの……","female":"ううん……私にとってこの星座表はとても大切なの……","variant_male_record_index":"134470","variant_female_record_index":"134471","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220607005:1":{"text":"私のお父さんは……ベテランの操舵手なの。毎年帰ってくるって約束してくれて、ほとんど破ったことがないのよ。","source_cn":"我的爸爸……是个经验丰富的舵手，他答应过我每年都会回来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41A512B1D6DDC12D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220607006:1":{"text":"子どもの頃、帰り道が分からなくなったらどうするのか、お父さんに聞いたことがあるの。","source_cn":"在我很小的时候问过他，如果他找不到回家的路怎么办。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1F96CDC91B3B63E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220607007:1":{"text":"そうしたらね、「空に浮かぶ星座を見ていれば迷うことはない」って教えてくれたの。","source_cn":"他告诉我，只要看懂天上的星座，就永远不会迷路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x924A0959F46179E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220607008:1":{"text":"でもある日を境に、お父さんが操縦してた船は帰ってこなかった……","source_cn":"但后来有一天，他掌舵的那艘船再也没回来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DEC01CEC90AB8E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1220607008":{"text":"でもある日を境に、お父さんが操縦してた船は帰ってこなかった……","source_cn":"但后来有一天，他掌舵的那艘船再也没回来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DEC01CEC90AB8E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220607009:1":{"text":"ううん、いいの。私はもう……大丈夫だから。","source_cn":"不不，没什么，我已经……不难过了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0D3E30F7E92152AB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ううん、いいの。私はもう……大丈夫だから。","female":"ううん、いいの。私はもう……大丈夫だから。","variant_male_record_index":"134478","variant_female_record_index":"134479","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220607011:1":{"text":"それで、お父さんを思い出すためにこの星座表を描いてたのですか？","source_cn":"所以，你画这张星座图式为了纪念你爸爸？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC97DF586A95463F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220607012:1":{"text":"えぇ、そうよ。私の未来のためでもあるわ。","source_cn":"嗯，是的，但也是为了我的未来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C4C6BEF1D4D12A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220607013:1":{"text":"お父さんが遭難してから、お母さんは人が変わったみたいに私が操舵手になることに反対して、遠出を許さなくなったの。","source_cn":"父亲遇难后，妈妈就像变了个人一样，不再愿意我成为一名舵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0ADFD79ADB1DD14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220607014:1":{"text":"それはあなたまで失いたくないからです……","source_cn":"其实，你妈妈只是害怕失去你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x277178AAFB31100B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220607015:1":{"text":"分かってるけど、私ももう大人だもん。子どもみたいにお母さんのそばで一生を過ごす気はないわ。","source_cn":"我明白，可我已经长大了，不能像个小孩子，缩在妈妈身边度...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0004EF630FD45942","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220607016:1":{"text":"私はね、操舵手が船を操るように、自分の未来を自分で決めたいの！","source_cn":"我想要掌控自己的未来，就像舵手掌控船的方向！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B3B43D70BBDF31A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1220607017:1":{"text":"行き先を決めたらすぐに出航して、収穫を船いっぱいに積んで帰るの……空に浮かぶ星座を見ていれば迷うことはないもの！","source_cn":"决定了去哪里后就出航，有了收获就满载而归——只要看懂天...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE7DB9E149636209","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1220607018:1":{"text":"自分の未来を決める操舵手……君ならきっとなれますよ！","source_cn":"决定自己未来的舵手——你一定能做到的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40BEDF128CE2ECD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220607019:1":{"text":"うん！ありがとう、私帰るね。","source_cn":"我会的！谢谢你们，我该回去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75A45D2537FC3EBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1220607020:1":{"text":"あの……また会えるかな？","source_cn":"那个……我们以后还会再见面吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E49029FDF1E9553","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index"